{
  "name": "Mossbank",
  "category": "Business dashboards",
  "kind": "template",
  "summary": "People, time and payroll for a 40-person design and build studio, with a pay-day countdown ring",
  "about": "An eight-page people app for a design and build studio with crews on four sites, a joinery workshop and a studio. A ring on the overview fills toward the next pay run while a shift heat calendar shows how much of each crew is at work. People, timesheets, payroll, leave, hiring, reports and settings all work, on a lilac and cream canvas with one deep plum card.",
  "how": [
    "Open a page from the pill bar: Overview, People, Time, Payroll, Leave, Hiring, Reports or Settings",
    "Flip through new starters on the overview and tick off steps in their first-week plan",
    "Start and pause your clock on the Time page, then approve or query this week's timesheets",
    "Pick a person on Payroll, tap a day to correct their hours, and move the pay run to the next stage",
    "Approve or decline leave, book leave with checks on dates and balance, and drag candidates between columns",
    "Press Ctrl+K to jump anywhere, switch theme, and reset demo data in Settings"
  ],
